  "notes": "{正午|しょうご} is a more formal word for noon compared to {昼|ひる}.\n\nCOMPARISON:\n- {正午|しょうご}: precisely 12:00 PM, formal\n- {昼|ひる}: general daytime/noon, casual\n- お{昼|ひる}: polite form, often used for \"lunch\"\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {正午|しょうご}ちょうど (exactly at noon)\n- {正午|しょうご}{過|す}ぎ (past noon)\n- {正午|しょうご}{前|まえ} (before noon)",
